{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1300443-avatar-experience","id":1300443,"title":"Avatar Experience","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-03-27T18:43:41-07:00","id":1300443,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon1.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Avatar Experience","content":"This rules hack is inspired by <b>Mage: the Awakening</b>'s Arcane Experience. The idea is that you accrue two kinds of Experience Points: regular experience and Avatar Experience. Avatar Experience can be spent on Arete, Spheres, certain Backgrounds, and supernatural Merits; regular experience can be spent on everything else. There's also a bit of crossover in that Avatar Experience can be spent to increase Abilities that are associated with your Practice. <br /> <br /> Avatar Experience is so named because it comes from your Avatar (as opposed to being earned <i>by</i> your Avatar). The methods by which you earn it are determined by what your Avatar is trying to teach you, and tends to reflect your Avatar's Essence. I'm thinking that they should also come from properly roleplaying your Paradigm. <br /> <br /> That's as far as I've gotten so far. I have a rough idea of borrowing loosely from the <b>Mage Chronicler's Guide</b> about its suggestion of a Milestones system; but I'm open to suggestions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 12-12-2019, 09:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T10:59:29-07:00","id":1300609,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1300443-avatar-experience#post1300443\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This rules hack is inspired by <b>Mage: the Awakening</b>'s Arcane Experience. The idea is that you accrue two kinds of Experience Points: regular experience and Avatar Experience. Avatar Experience can be spent on Arete, Spheres, certain Backgrounds, and supernatural Merits; regular experience can be spent on everything else. There's also a bit of crossover in that Avatar Experience can be spent to increase Abilities that are associated with your Practice.<br /> <br /> Avatar Experience is so named because it comes from your Avatar (as opposed to being earned <i>by</i> your Avatar). The methods by which you earn it are determined by what your Avatar is trying to teach you, and tends to reflect your Avatar's Essence.<br /> <br /> That's as far as I've gotten so far. I have a rough idea of borrowing loosely from the <b>Mage Chronicler's Guide</b> about its suggestion of a Milestones system; but I'm open to suggestions.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait...<br /> <br /> WHAT?!<br /> <br /> I swear I came up with the house rule I mentioned 100% independently. I decided to just split experience two ways, and &quot;mundane&quot; and &quot;arcane&quot; sounded very fitting, since it refers to the mundane world and the arcane world, plus they rhyme with eachother. Total accident. Anyways, by a huge coincidence I came up with a similar system through convergent thinking with the writers of MTAw. But this is a happy coincidence since it means I can look at MTAw for inspiration.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11620,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","user":"twig","date":". 03-28-2019, 02:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-28T13:39:02-07:00","id":1300657,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1284949-making-a-new-mage-setting-anstruther-academy-for-young-awakened?p=1288222#post1288222\">Yes indeed, you did!</a> (For Dataweaver's reference)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}